        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5lydCQstBOsYH9ejDWw0-31" value="Given we have an Elliptic curve over \(\Q\), then for each prime, choose the factorization of: \(L_p((s,E) = (1 - \alpha(p) p^{-s})(1 - \beta(p)p^{-s}). We now compute the arithmetic term: \(g_{an}(\Delta,E) = -\dfrac{1}{\Delta pi} \sum_{p \leq \exp(2\Delta \pi)} \log p \sum_{k=1}" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="WIyWlLk6GJQsqaUBKTNV-1">
